:"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......這和我沒關係，我不是負責的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"*俄語粗口*，今天你別想活著出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是......別......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"你完了，*俄語粗口*，你死定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"別！別打我！不是我幹的！別！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山大！別這樣！冷靜點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個衛兵隊長去哪兒了？就那位領主之女？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"她追著逃走的人跑出去了，巡林者跟著她一起過去了，別擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......醫生身上的結晶......在發光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快？為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別管這個了！找個房間！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你們要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及解釋了！動作快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找布料來！窗簾、床單，什麼都可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"把醫生抬到那邊的小屋子裡！快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生怎麼了？為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寇，寇恩小姐，請您冷靜一下，芙蘭卡已經在處理醫生的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"處理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"處理什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒有見過嗎？我可能要之後再來解釋——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堵住門窗！不要留出縫隙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"煙囪！把煙囪也堵住！還有通風口！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......這是在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚？醫生的屍體......出什麼問題了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"別去看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"別去看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"上面堵死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"門窗堵死了！沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，屋子裡亮起來了？窗戶在發光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寇恩小姐！別靠近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","sp